@startuml F5.9-D03-confirmar-importacao
title F5.9-D03 — Confirmar importação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ImportController" as Ctrl
participant "ConfirmImportUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar importação
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /importacoes/{jobId}/confirm
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: INSERT lote(s)\n+ audit_log\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: SUCCESS
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 relatório
WebApp --> Sec: N importados

@enduml
